    repository-code: "https://zenodo.org/records/18790007"
    notes: >-
      Primary methodology reference. Establishes the TMCMC Bayesian
      identification and multiscale FEM uncertainty propagation
      framework (0D ODE → 1D/2D reaction-diffusion PDE → 3D Abaqus)
      that is adapted in wafer-proc-sim for semiconductor process
      calibration. Hamilton 5-species oral biofilm model with
      Dysbiotic Index (DI) mapping.

